---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { businessConfig } from '../config/business';
import { ShieldCheck } from 'lucide-astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Garage Doors Service Team Queens"
  description="Privacy Policy for Garage Doors Service Team Queens. Learn how we collect, use, and protect your personal and service request information."
  canonicalPath="/privacy-policy"
>
  <section class="bg-primary text-white py-14 sm:py-16 border-b border-navy-700">
    <div class="container-custom max-w-4xl text-center space-y-3">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-navy-700 text-accent text-xs font-semibold">
        <ShieldCheck class="w-3.5 h-3.5" />
        <span>Legal & Privacy</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-300">
        Effective Date: November 1, 2026 • Last Updated: November 1, 2026
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 bg-white">
    <div class="container-custom max-w-3xl prose prose-slate prose-headings:font-heading prose-headings:text-primary space-y-8 text-sm sm:text-base text-content-dark leading-relaxed">
      
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-primary mb-3">1. Introduction</h2>
        <p>
          Garage Doors Service Team Queens ("we," "our," or "us") respects your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and protect personal information when you visit our website, submit service inquiries, schedule appointments, or interact with our communication channels in Queens, New York.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-primary mb-3">2. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>We may collect information directly from you when you interact with our website:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 mt-2">
          <li><strong>Contact Information:</strong> Full name, telephone number, email address, and physical service address or ZIP code in Queens, NY.</li>
          <li><strong>Service Inquiry Details:</strong> Information regarding your garage door system, symptoms, preferred appointment times, and uploaded photos of garage door hardware.</li>
          <li><strong>Communications:</strong> Records of messages sent via our website forms, live chat, or WhatsApp.</li>
          <li><strong>Technical Data:</strong> Browser type, device characteristics, IP address, and interaction data collected through cookies or basic analytics tools to maintain site security and performance.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-primary mb-3">3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p>We use the collected information solely for legitimate business purposes:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 mt-2">
          <li>To evaluate, schedule, and deliver residential garage door services and estimates.</li>
          <li>To communicate with you regarding service availability, dispatch status, or quotes.</li>
          <li>To follow up on completed service visits or respond to warranty inquiries.</li>
          <li>To detect, prevent, and address security incidents or spam submissions.</li>
          <li>To comply with applicable legal obligations under New York State and federal law.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-primary mb-3">4. SMS and Telecommunications Policy (TCPA Compliance)</h2>
        <p>
          When you provide your phone number and opt in via our website forms, you consent to receive calls and text messages (SMS) from Garage Doors Service Team Queens regarding your service request, appointment confirmations, and estimates. Message and data rates may apply. You may reply <strong>STOP</strong> at any time to opt out of SMS communications.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-primary mb-3">5. Third-Party Service Providers</h2>
        <p>
          We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal information. We may share information with trusted third-party service providers solely to operate our business:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 mt-2">
          <li>Customer Relationship Management (CRM) and scheduling software (such as GoHighLevel) to manage service records and appointments.</li>
          <li>Secure cloud web hosting and communication gateways.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-primary mb-3">6. Data Security and Protection</h2>
        <p>
          We implement commercially reasonable administrative, technical, and physical safeguards in accordance with New York State data security guidelines (including the New York SHIELD Act) to protect your personal data from unauthorized access, alteration, or disclosure.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-primary mb-3">7. Your Rights and Contact Information</h2>
        <p>
          You have the right to request access to the personal information we maintain about you, ask for corrections, or request deletion of your records.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-2">
          To exercise your rights or ask questions regarding this policy, contact our team through our <a href="/contact" class="text-accent underline">Contact Page</a>.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
